  "description": "Who did I go on a blind date with?\n\nHan Bom, a first-year surgery resident at YJ. She flinched at the wild, masculine appearance of the man she was set up with, but she rejected him as planned. Just as she was about to leave having achieved her objective, Bom witnessed someone collapsing at the hotel and ended up saving them together with her date.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
